      "id": "claim_b6a59511275c4f5d9f7ffbda6a4159ff",
      "statement": "@mota/db is the only workspace that touches PostgreSQL and exports exactly four capabilities through its barrel: createDatabase, migrateDatabase, DrizzleUserSettingsRepository, and the userSettings table definition; per AGENTS.md the package imports @mota/contracts and Drizzle only and never imports Nest or React, so the API depends on it only through the UserSettingsRepository interface.",
